@host = http://localhost:8080

### Free-text question
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Give me a dad joke"
}

### Free-text question with Result<T> metadata (LangChain4j-only)
POST {{host}}/ask/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Give me a dad joke"
}

### Structured output: single field
GET {{host}}/capital?country=France

### Structured output: typed record
GET {{host}}/capital/details?country=France

### Structured output: list
GET {{host}}/capitals?region=Scandinavia
